### REST Client (VS Code) / IntelliJ HTTP Client
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@date = 2030-01-02
@adminToken = paste-admin-token
@doctorToken = paste-doctor-token
@appointmentId = 1
@appointmentCode = paste-booking-code

### Clinic
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/clinic

### Services
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services

### Doctors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors

### Book WITHOUT doctorId; use a future date
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "email": "patient@example.com",
  "serviceId": 2,
  "preferredDate": "{{date}}",
  "preferredTime": "09:00",
  "note": "Kham rang"
}

### Lookup with code returned by booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentCode}}

### Admin login; copy accessToken to adminToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"Admin123!"}

### Assign; replace appointmentId with ID from booking
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"doctorId":1,"appointmentDate":"{{date}}","startTime":"09:00"}

### Doctor login; copy accessToken to doctorToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"doctor1","password":"Doctor123!"}

### Assigned appointments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### Confirm
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"CONFIRMED"}

### Complete
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"COMPLETED"}

### Available slots with service duration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/doctors/1/available-slots?date={{date}}&serviceId=2

### Current account
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}

### Logout immediately revokes this token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorToken}}
